  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>If you're looking for a university that combines academic excellence with strong career prospects, College de Paris can be a good choice for you. You’ll benefit from both an international perspective and the landscape of Paris. You’ll be exploring one of the most popular attractions in the world, and also be in a global hub for international companies, giving you a distinct edge in today’s job market.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>College de Paris offers a variety of student clubs and organisations for you to enrich your campus life. From visiting iconic landmarks to exploring the city's cafes, galleries, and markets, there’s always something to explore. Plus, you’ll be in an international student community as well.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>College de Paris does not provide any on-campus accommodation. However, you can look for student housing, such as private apartments and shared accommodation, near the campus.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
